WEBVTT

00:10.419 --> 00:11.201
Okay.

00:20.818 --> 00:24.561
You learned

00:24.581 --> 00:30.287
to live in shifting sands With no safe place to

00:30.547 --> 00:35.052
ever land You learned that doors could slam and

00:35.072 --> 00:41.138
lock Against the ticking of the clock You learn

00:41.158 --> 00:46.905
to touch, could be a cage A quiet simmering bit of

00:47.125 --> 00:52.872
rage But that old world is dead and gone It's time

00:52.892 --> 00:58.118
to face a brand new dawn So let my arms be your new

00:58.399 --> 01:04.042
one To catch you every time you fall This heart of

01:04.062 --> 01:09.024
stands, it will not break For your own precious,

01:09.104 --> 01:15.268
gentle sake If it's a heart that you should need A

01:15.328 --> 01:20.890
simple, pure, loving creed Then I am here, my

01:20.930 --> 01:22.551
love is true

01:26.285 --> 01:30.362
My arms will be a home for you

01:53.058 --> 01:58.021
No need to brace, no need to hide With your two

01:58.101 --> 02:03.604
sisters by your side We'll be the lock, we'll be

02:03.644 --> 02:10.808
the key To your own safe reality We'll be the roof

02:10.928 --> 02:16.912
against the rain To wash away the hurt and pain

02:17.112 --> 02:20.354
This is a vow we'll always keep

02:24.072 --> 02:29.027
While you are in your trouble

02:29.147 --> 02:29.488
Sleep

